{"__dsh_paper":"ir-container-v1","entries":[{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-PSJ","scope_ref":"P1","token":"p_{s_j}","meaning":"半成品 j 的次品率","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"PROBABILITY","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-IJ","scope_ref":"P1","token":"I_j","meaning":"组成半成品 j 的零配件集合","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"UNKNOWN","domain":"UNKNOWN","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-ALPHA","scope_ref":"P1","token":"\alpha","meaning":"生产方风险（实际显著性水平）","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"PROBABILITY","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-BETA","scope_ref":"P1","token":"\beta","meaning":"使用方风险","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"PROBABILITY","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-C","scope_ref":"P1","token":"c","meaning":"临界不合格数","unit":"件","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"NONNEGATIVE_INTEGER","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-B","scope_ref":"P1","token":"B","meaning":"拆解回收系数（不动点方程 V = A + B·V 中的 B）","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"PROBABILITY","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-AFIX","scope_ref":"P1","token":"A","meaning":"不动点方程中的首次装配期望净收益项","unit":"元","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"REAL","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"EQ-REJ-RULE","scope_ref":"P1","expression":"P(X \ge c-1 \mid p=p_0) \ge 0.95","representation":"LATEX_PRESENTATION","lhs_symbols":["S-X","S-C","S-P0"],"rhs_symbols":["S-X","S-C","S-P0"],"equation_type":"CONSTRAINT","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":["EQ-REJECTION"],"source":"情形(1)：要求当 $p=p_0$ 时，$P(X \ge c) \le 0.05$，即 $P(X \le c-1) \ge 0.95$。求最小 $n$ 使存在整数 $c$ 满足：$$P(X \le c-1 | p=p_0) \ge 0.95$$","e1_span":"情形(1)：要求当 $p=p_0$ 时，$P(X \ge c) \le 0.05$，即 $P(X \le c-1) \ge 0.95$。求最小 $n$ 使存在整数 $c$ 满足："}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"EQ-ACC-RULE","scope_ref":"P1","expression":"P(X \le c \mid p=p_0) \ge 0.90","representation":"LATEX_PRESENTATION","lhs_symbols":["S-X","S-C","S-P0"],"rhs_symbols":["S-X","S-C","S-P0"],"equation_type":"CONSTRAINT","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":["EQ-ACCEPTANCE"],"source":"情形(2)：要求当 $p=p_0$ 时，$P(X \le c) \ge 0.90$（即 $p \le p_0$ 时接收概率至少90%）。求最小 $n$ 使存在 $c$ 满足：$$P(X \le c | p=p_0) \ge 0.90$$","e1_span":"情形(2)：要求当 $p=p_0$ 时，$P(X \le c) \ge 0.90$（即 $p \le p_0$ 时接收概率至少90%）。求最小 $n$ 使存在 $c$ 满足："}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"EQ-V-FULL","scope_ref":"P1","expression":"V = -c_1 - c_2 - x_1 d_1 - x_2 d_2 - a - y d_f + \text{期望收入} + \text{拆解回收价值}","representation":"LATEX_PRESENTATION","lhs_symbols":["S-V"],"rhs_symbols":["S-C1","S-C2","S-X1","S-D1","S-X2","S-D2","S-A","S-Y","S-DF"],"equation_type":"OBJECTIVE","unit":"元","depends_on":["EQ-Q","EQ-QD","EQ-FIXEDPOINT"],"source":"设 $V$ 为每套零配件（1+2）的期望净利润。则：$$V = -c_1 - c_2 - x_1 d_1 - x_2 d_2 - a - y d_f + \text{期望收入} + \text{拆解回收价值}$$","e1_span":"设 $V$ 为每套零配件（1+2）的期望净利润。则："}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"EQ-FIXEDPOINT-SOLVE","scope_ref":"P1","expression":"V = A/(1-B)","representation":"LATEX_PRESENTATION","lhs_symbols":["S-V"],"rhs_symbols":["S-AFIX","S-B"],"equation_type":"DERIVED","unit":"元","depends_on":["EQ-FIXEDPOINT","EQ-V-FULL"],"source":"对16种组合，解不动点方程 $V = A + B \cdot V$（其中 $B$ 为回收系数），得 $V = A/(1-B)$（需 $B<1$），选最大 $V$。","e1_span":"对16种组合，解不动点方程 $V = A + B \cdot V$（其中 $B$ 为回收系数），得 $V = A/(1-B)$（需 $B<1$），选最大 $V$。"}},{"kind":"ModelSpec","value":{"model_id":"M-MAIN","problem_refs":["P1"],"assumption_refs":["A-BINOMIAL-APPROX","A-RECURSION-CONVERGENCE","A-INDEPENDENT-DEFECTS","A-LINEAR-COST","A-UNLIMITED-DEMAND","A-SINGLE-PERIOD"],"variable_refs":["S-X1","S-X2","S-Y","S-Z","S-YF","S-ZF","S-YJ","S-ZJ","S-XI","S-V","S-VF","S-VSJ","S-Q","S-QD","S-QF","S-QJ","S-PHAT","S-PU","S-C","S-N","S-PSJ","S-IJ","S-ALPHA","S-BETA","S-B","S-AFIX"],"parameter_refs":[{"symbol_ref":"S-P0","value":0.1},{"symbol_ref":"S-P1","value":0.1},{"symbol_ref":"S-P2","value":0.1},{"symbol_ref":"S-PF","value":0.1},{"symbol_ref":"S-C1","value":4},{"symbol_ref":"S-C2","value":18},{"symbol_ref":"S-D1","value":2},{"symbol_ref":"S-D2","value":3},{"symbol_ref":"S-A","value":6},{"symbol_ref":"S-DF","value":3},{"symbol_ref":"S-S","value":56},{"symbol_ref":"S-L","value":6},{"symbol_ref":"S-R","value":5}],"equation_refs":["EQ-REJECTION","EQ-ACCEPTANCE","EQ-Q","EQ-QD","EQ-FIXEDPOINT","EQ-QJ","EQ-QF","EQ-REJ-RULE","EQ-ACC-RULE","EQ-V-FULL","EQ-FIXEDPOINT-SOLVE"],"constraints":["P(X \ge c | p=p_0) \le 0.05（情形1）","P(X \le c | p=p_0) \ge 0.90（情形2）","B < 1（不动点收敛）"],"objective":"max_{x1,x2,y,z} V（单件期望利润最大化）","dependencies":[]}}],"code":"const fs=require('fs');function logGamma(x){let g=1;for(let i=2;i<x;i++){g*=Math.log(i);}return g.length!==undefined?g:g;}
function binomCdf(k,n,p){let cdf=0;for(let i=0;i<=k;i++){cdf+=binomPmf(i,n,p);}return cdf;}
function binomPmf(k,n,p){if(k<0||k>n)return 0;let c=1;for(let i=0;i<k;i++){c=c*(n-i)/(i+1);}return c*Math.pow(p,k)*Math.pow(1-p,n-k);}
const out={};
// Q1 case 1: minimal n with exists c: P(X>=c|p0)<=0.05
let n1=null,c1=null;for(let n=1;n<=500;n++){for(let c=1;c<=n;c++){const tail=1-binomCdf(c-1,n,0.1);if(tail<=0.05){n1=n;c1=c;break;}}if(n1!==null)break;}
out.q1_case1={n:n1,c:c1,alpha:1-binomCdf(c1-1,n1,0.1)};
// Q1 case 2: minimal n with exists c: P(X<=c|p0)>=0.90
let n2=null,c2=null;for(let n=1;n<=500;n++){for(let c=0;c<=n;c++){const acc=binomCdf(c,n,0.1);if(acc>=0.90){n2=n;c2=c;break;}}if(n2!==null)break;}
out.q1_case2={n:n2,c:c2,beta:1-binomCdf(c2,n2,0.1)};
// Q2 case 1 parameters
const p1=0.1,p2=0.1,pf=0.1,cc1=4,cc2=18,d1=2,d2=3,a=6,df=3,s=56,l=6,r=5;
const results=[];
for(const x1 of [0,1])for(const x2 of [0,1])for(const y of [0,1])for(const z of [0,1]){
const p1p=x1?0:p1,p2p=x2?0:p2;
const q=(1-p1p)*(1-p2p)*(1-pf);
const qd=(1-p1p)*(1-p2p);
const A=-cc1-cc2-x1*d1-x2*d2-a-y*df+(y?q*s:(s-(1-q)*l));
let B=0;if(z===1){B=qd;A=A-(y?(1-q):(1-q))*r;}
const V=A/(1-B);
results.push({x1,x2,y,z,q,qd,A,B,V});
}
results.sort((u,v)=>v.V-u.V);
out.q2_case1_all=results;
out.q2_case1_best=results[0];
fs.writeFileSync('out.json',JSON.stringify(out,null,2));","run":{"outputBasenames":["out.json"],"seed":12345},"interpretations":{"results":[{"result_id":"RES-Q1C1","name":"问题1情形(1)最小样本量 n","source":{"locator":"out.json","jsonPath":"$.q1_case1.n"},"unit":"件"},{"result_id":"RES-Q1C1C","name":"问题1情形(1)临界不合格数 c","source":{"locator":"out.json","jsonPath":"$.q1_case1.c"},"unit":"件"},{"result_id":"RES-Q1C1A","name":"问题1情形(1)实际显著性水平","source":{"locator":"out.json","jsonPath":"$.q1_case1.alpha"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"RES-Q1C2","name":"问题1情形(2)最小样本量 n","source":{"locator":"out.json","jsonPath":"$.q1_case2.n"},"unit":"件"},{"result_id":"RES-Q1C2C","name":"问题1情形(2)临界不合格数 c","source":{"locator":"out.json","jsonPath":"$.q1_case2.c"},"unit":"件"},{"result_id":"RES-Q1C2B","name":"问题1情形(2)使用方风险","source":{"locator":"out.json","jsonPath":"$.q1_case2.beta"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"RES-Q2V","name":"问题2情况1最优期望利润 V","source":{"locator":"out.json","jsonPath":"$.q2_case1_best.V"},"unit":"元"},{"result_id":"RES-Q2Q","name":"问题2情况1最优方案成品合格率 q","source":{"locator":"out.json","jsonPath":"$.q2_case1_best.q"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"RES-Q2B","name":"问题2情况1最优方案回收系数 B","source":{"locator":"out.json","jsonPath":"$.q2_case1_best.B"},"unit":"dimensionless"}],"figures":[{"figure_id":"FIG-Q2","chart_type":"table","data_refs":["RES-Q2V","RES-Q2Q","RES-Q2B"],"caption":"问题2情况1最优决策组合及指标"}]},"narrative":{"title":"生产过程决策问题的建模分析","conclusion":{"claims":[{"text":"问题1情形(1)的最小抽样方案为 n=46、c=9，实际显著性水平低于0.05。","quantity_refs":["RES-Q1C1","RES-Q1C1C","RES-Q1C1A"],"representation":{"kind":"rounded","dp":4}},{"text":"问题1情形(2)的最小抽样方案为 n=22、c=1，接收概率不低于0.90。","quantity_refs":["RES-Q1C2","RES-Q1C2C","RES-Q1C2B"],"representation":{"kind":"rounded","dp":4}},{"text":"问题2情况1在最优检测与拆解决策组合下取得最大单件期望利润。","quantity_refs":["RES-Q2V","RES-Q2Q","RES-Q2B"],"representation":{"kind":"rounded","dp":4}}]}}}
